<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatia-te</book>
  <para style="h">Galatia-te</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatia-te</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatia-te</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatia-te</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte sawlna tawh ahi lo, thunei mihingte tung pan zong hi loin Jesu Khris le misite lah panin ama a thosah Pasien tung panin sawltahpi khat ahi keima Paul le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka ompi Pasien’ innkuonpite zosie in, Galati gam hlattuom pawlpite tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note tungah i Pa Pasien le i Topa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina le kilemna hing tung taheh, ci-in kang hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I Pa Pasien’ deina tawh kizui-in tuhun khang gilo panin ei hunkhie dingin eite’ mawna zieha ama le ama ang kipiekhie pa ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama tungah minthanna om zingzing taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khris’ hepina sungah note ang hlan pa nuasie-in adang lungdamna thu-ah na kihei tahzuoi uh lamdang ka sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungdamna thu adang a om sih a, ahi vangin mi kimkhat in note hing buoisahin tua Khris’ lungdamna thu a lehei sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hizongle note tungah kang hilsa uh lungdamna thu tawh a kilengatin kote nangawnin ahi a, vantung panin vantungmi khat in ahi zongin note tunga ang gen a op leh tua mi pa in samsietna nga taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Masang lama kang gensa bangin kang genkiana-ah, note kungah na sansa uh thu tawh a kilengat ahi adang lungdamna thu ang gen mi khatpo a op leh tua mi pa in samsietna thuoh taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in mihingte’ maipha sui ka mah, ahi sihle Pasien’ maipha sui ka hei? Mite po a lungdamsah sawm lailai ka hi mawh leh Khris’ nasem ka hi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, keima in kang hil lungdamna thu pen mihingte’ bawltawm ahi lo lam na thei ding uh ka dei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile tua thu pen mihing tung pana ka nga hi loin ei kihil zong ahi sih a, Jesu Khris’ ang kilahna pana ka nga ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in Judah biehna sunga ka om lai-a ka hinkhuo masa lamte na za zo ta uhi. Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpite nahpi tahin ka na bawlsie a, suhsiet ding ka na hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate’ tang ngainate pawnthaw mama ka hi ziehin Jew biehna sunga ka mipi ka khanguolte lahah a madawh penin ka na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle ka suo masangin kei ei tuom koi-a ama’ hepina tungtawnin keima ei hlan Pasien in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gentile-te lahah ama’ thu ka gen thei nadingin keima tungah lungkimtahin a Tapa ang kilahsah lai-in mi koima khat zong ka dong sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka masanga sawltahpi na suohsate dong dingin zong Jerusalem ah peito tuon loin, thakhatthu-in Arabia gamah ka pei zaw a, tua zaw ciengin Damascus ah ka kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zaw kum thum ciengin Cephas kunga haw dingin Jerusalem ah ka peito a, ama kungah ni sawm le ni nga sung ka tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ sanggam pa James simlo sawltahpi dangte khat zong ka mu kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note tunga kang giel laite pen Pasien mai-a kang giel ahi a, zuouthu ka gen vawt sih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Syria le Cilicia gam sung teng ah ka pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khris sunga a om Judea gam hlattuom pawlpite in ka melin kei ei thei nai sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate in, “Masang lama ei bawlsie pa in khatvei lai-a suhsiet a sawm tua upna thu tu-in tangko ta mel,” ci-a a kigen thu beh a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale keima ziehin amate in Pasien’ min a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw kum sawm le kum li ciengin Barnabas tawh Jerusalem khuo ah ka peito kia a, Titus zong ka zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilahna dung zui-a a pei ka hi hi. Tua ciengin (a makai deute beh a tuomin ka kimupi vangin) a mawhna-a tai ka suo lo nadingin amate mai-ah Gentile-te lahah ka hilsa lungdamna thu ka va lui ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle ka zawpi pa Titus nangawn zong Greek-te khat ahi vangin a tep tan dingin a kipausawl tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in sila ei suosah thei nadingun kote in Khris Jesu sunga ka nei uh suotahna thu a kandap dingin a zuou thei thu umte ang daplut zieha tua banga kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note tawh lungdamna thuman thutah a op suoh thei nadingin kote in mitphet kal sung nangawn amau’ thu ka mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Makai-a kinei mite tung panin (kei tungah amate in kilamdanna a bawl tuon sih uhi; Pasien in maitang zatah tuom nei lo hi) - tua makaite in kei tungah bangma ei sep pieh tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale mahin tep kitan mite kunga lungdamna thuhil ding pen Peter tungah a ki-ap ma bangin, teptan lo mite kunga lungdamna thuhil ding zong keima tunga ei ki-apna thu a mu zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Bangzieh ahei cile a tep kitansate dinga sawltahpi a suosah ahi Peter tungtawnin na a sem pa in kei tungtawnin zong na hing semin Gentile-te adingin ei sawl a,)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khuompi banga a kiciemte makaite ahi James, Cephas le John-te in keima tungah hepina ei kipie zo hi, ci thu a thei ciengun Barbabas le keima tungah kilawmtatna zietlam khut ei pie vua, ko gel pen Gentile-te kungah pei-in, amate ahile tep kitan mite kunga pei ding a thukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in mizawngte ka phaw ding uh beh ei kal vua, tua thu lah ka sep nop pen ma uh hi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle Antioch khuo ah Peter ang tun ciengin ama mawsah nading thu om ahi ziehin a maitangah ka sel pai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />azieh pen James kung pana ang pei mi pawlkhat ang tun masangun Peter pen Gentile-te tawh an neton let kimlai, amate ang tun tah ciengun tep kitan pawlte a giin ziehin nuatawnin ama le ama a kiningkoi ta vanuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jew midangte in tami kineitawmna pen a zui pai mintah vua, a kineitawmna un Banabas nangawn zong a peikhielsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin lungdamna thuman thutah tawh kituohin a gamtat lo lam uh ka mu ciengin amate zosie’ zahin Peter kungah, “Nang Jew mite khat lawmlawm in Jew mite khat bangin om loin Gentile-te khat banga a nungta lel na hi leh, Jew mite banga Gentile-te a nuntat nadingun bangci bangin paubawl sawm teitei thei ding na hei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eimate mama zong Judah mi-a pieng vive i hi vua, mawnei Gentile-te i hi sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hinanle eite in thukham zuina hang hi loin, Jesu Khris upna tungtawnin mi khat in dihtansahna nga hi, ci thu i thei uhi. Eite in zong thukham zuina hang hi loin, Khris upna hang tawh dihtansahna i nga thei nadingun Khris Jesu i um uhi, azieh pen koima in thukham zuina tawh dihtansahna nga lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite in Khris sungah dihtansahna i nga nadinga i hanciemna un ei le ei mawnei i hi lam ei kimusah ahile, Khris pen mawna’ sila pa ahi amah? Hi poma lo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka phelsa nate ma ka lamkia leh thukham palsat pa ka hi lam kei le kei a kipulah ka hi gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien adinga ka hin thei nadingin thukham tungtawnin thukham ah kei ka si hi. Singlamte tungah Khris tawh ka kikhaiton zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a hing lai pen kei hi nawn loin ka sunga ang teng Khris hizaw hi. Tuale ka tahsa sungah tu-a ka hinna pen keima ei it a, keima dinga ama le ama ang kipie Pasien upna tawh a hing ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in Pasien’ hepina ka paikhie sih hi; bangzieh ahei cile thukham tungtawna dihtansahna kinga hi leh Khris pen a mawhna-a si hi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No Galati mimawte! Koi in ang bumlawm ta uh ahei? Singlamte tungah Jesu Khris a kikhailia bangin na mitmu-un kicientahin ang kilah zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note tung panin tami thukhat beh ka thei nuom hi: Thukham zuina hang tawh Hlagau nga na hi uh amah, ahi sihle na zah uh thu na upna zieh vua a nga na hizaw uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamza taha maw na hi talawm uh amah? Hlagau tawh na kipat zaw ciengun, tu-in cilesa tawh khup sawm na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua za taha na gim thuohna uh a mawhna suoh ding a ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hoi hi, tuale thukham na zui ziehun Pasien in Hlagau hing pie-in note lahah nalamdang ang sep ahi amah, ahi sihle na zahte uh na upna zieh uh hizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Abraham in, “Pasien um a, tua a upna pen dihna-in kisimpieh hi,”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in a um mite Abraham’ suonlehlahte hi, ci thei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in upna tawh Gentile-te dih a tansah ding lam Lai Siengtho in na mukhol a, “Nangma sungah Gentile-te zosie thupha kipie ding hi,” ci-in Abraham tungah lungdamna thu na magen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin a um mite, Abraham tawh thupha kipieton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen thukham zuina tunga a kinga mi zosie pen samsietna nei-a om ahi uhi; bang ding ahei cile, “Thukham laibu sunga kigiel thu zosie zui-in a mang lo mi zosie in samsietna a thuoh uhi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in ahile thukham zuina tawh koima in Pasien mai-ah dih a tan zo lo lam kicien mama hi; azieh pen, “Midih pa upna tawh nungta ding hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle upna tungah thukham a kinga sih hi; tuale mahin, “Thukham a zui mi poma tuate ma tawh a nungta ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khris in thukham samsietna panin ei tankhie zo a, eite adingin a kisamsie pa ang suoh hi. Bangzieh ahei cile, “Singkhuom tunga kikhai mi zosie samsiet thuoh ahi hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua pen Gentile-te kungah Khris Jesu sunga om Abraham’ thuphate a tun thei nading le upna tungtawnin eite in Hlagau’ kamciem i nga thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, nisim hinkhuo panin gentena khat kang gen ding hi: Mi khat’ thuciemna pen khatvei a kikipsah zaw ciengin koima in belap thei loin, zong phiet thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in ahile Abraham le ama’ suonlehlah pa tungah kamciemte kibawl zo hi. “Na suonlehlahte,” ci-in mi tampi gen hi loin, mi khat beh ahi Khris gennopna-in, “Na suonlehlah pa,” na cizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka gennop tami ahi hi: Tua kamciem a kiphiet thei nadingin tua zaw kum zali le sawm thum cienga a tung pan thukham in masang lai-a Pasien in a kipsahsa tua thuciemna pen a phiet thei malmal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen thukham panin gouluoza ang pei hi mawh leh kamciemna zieh hi nawn lo ding hi; ahi vangin Pasien in kamciemna tungtawnin Abraham tungah tua gouluoza a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile bang dinga thukham na kipie ahei? Ama tungah kamciem a kibawlna ama’ suonlehlah pa ang tun masangsie, tua tawnkhielnate zieha kipiehbe ahi bo hi; tua thukham pen vantung mite tungtawnin palai khat tawh kikipsah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in ahile mi khat sanga a tamzaw munah palai kizang hi; ahi vangin Pasien khat beh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahile thukham in Pasien’ kamciemte a langpan amah? A langpan vawt sih hi! Bangzieh ahei cile hinna a pie thei thukham na kipie ahile dihtansahna pen thukham tungtawna ang pei tahtah hi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hizongle Jesu Khris upna tungtawnin a um mite tungah tua a kikamciem pen a kipieh thei nadingin Lai Siengtho in mawna vanglietna nei-ah sil bangkim a khumcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Upna ang tun masang, upna thu ang kilah masang tengin thukham nei-ah eite ei kikhumcipin ei kicing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin upna tawh dih i tan thei nadingin Khris ang pei cieng dong, tua thukham pen eite ei cingpa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in upna ang tun zo tah ziehin tua a cingpa’ khut nei-ah i om nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen na unpi-un upna tungtawnin Khris Jesu sungah Pasien’ tate na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Khris sungah a ki-baptize sa note zosie in Khris na sil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Judah mi le Greek mi ci om nawn lo a, sila le suohta mi, numei le pasal ci bang om nawn lo hi; azieh pen na unpi-un Khris Jesu sungah khat na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Note Khris-a’ na hi uleh Abraham’ suonlehlahte na hi ta vua, kamciemna bangin gouluote zong na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka gennop tami ahi hi: Gouluo dingte pen neisa zosie a luo dingte hinanle naupang ahi laisie uh sila sangin a thupizaw kan sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa sesa hun ciengtan a tun masangsie a cing le a kemte’ uhna nei-ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite zong tua bang ma i hi uhi; naupang i hi hun sungin leitung thungehte khut nei-ah salin i om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin hun bukim ang tun ciengin Pasien in numei pana a pieng thukham nei-a a suoh a Tapa ang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua in thukham khut nei-a om mite ei tat nading le a tate banga tapa suona i nga thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tapate na hi ziehun Pasien in eite’ lungtangah a tapa’ Hlagau ang sawl a, “Abba! Pa!” ci-in ei kikosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n note na hi ule sila hi nawn loin tapa na hi ta vua, tapa na hi uleh gouluo pa zong na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nidang Pasien na thei lo hun lai-un a pien limin Pasien ahi lote’ suoh le salin na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in Pasien na thei ta vua, Pasien in zong note ang thei ta hi, tua ahile bangci bangin a thanem le a gina lo ahi leitung thungehte lam po-ah kihei-in khatvei salsuoh nuomkia na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in ni thupite, hlate, khuohunte, le kumte na tang talawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note dinga ka nasep a mawhna a suo khah ding ka lunghimaw mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lawmte aw, kang thum hi, note op banga kang op ma bangin note zong kei op bangin hing om vawi un. Note in kei tungah khielna na bawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note tungah lungdamna thu kang gen masahna pen tahsa zawngkhalna zieh ahi lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka omdan pen note adingin ze-etna a suo vangin ei muda-in nei simmaw tuon sih vua, Khris Jesu le Pasien’ vantungmi khat bangin nei limbawl zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ngasa uh lungnopna bang na law ta uh ahei? Azieh pen ahi thei hi leh na mittangte uh ladawhin nei pie nuom va-ia uhi, ci teci ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuman thutah kang hilna ziehin tu-in na gal uh ka suoh ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in ang thupibawl mama vua, hinanle a ngimna uh a hoi sih hi; note in amate na thupisim nadingun ko kung pana ang khenkhie nuom uh ahi lel bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngimna hoi ahi nah po leh note tawh ka op sung beh hi loin, hun zosie-ah kithupi sim ding pen a hoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka it taneute aw, note sungah Khris pienzie lim ang op masangsie note adingin nausuo takei natna thuoh bangin ka omkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tungtang thu vuah amkham gawp ka hi ziehin note tawh ang omtonin ka thugen zong ka khel nuom va-ia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No thukham nei-a a om nuomkia mite aw, ei gen vawi un, thukham in a gen thu bang ahei ci za lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Abraham in tapa ni nei-in, khat pen a sila numei tawh a nei hi a, adang khat pen a suohta numei tawh a nei ahi hi, ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin sila numei tawh a nei tapa pen cilesa ngaina banga pieng hi a, a suohta numei tawh a nei tapa pen kamciemna tungtawna pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in tami pen tekahna ahi hi: Tami numei ni tegel pen thuciemna nite ahi hi. Numei khat pen Sinai Muol pana ang pei Hagar hi a, ama in sila a suoh ding tate a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Hagar pen Arabia gama Sinai Muol ahi a, tu hun Jerusalem tawh kibang hi, azieh pen a tate tawh ama salin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin adang numei pen a tung lama om Jerusalem tawh kibang hi; ama pen suohta a, eite’ nu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile, “Ta nei lo-a a ciing numei aw, lungdamin kipah in. Nausuo gimna a thuoh ngai lo nu aw, awng inlen nahpi-in kiko in; bangzieh ahei cile pasal nei numei nu sangin a kinuasie numei nu in ta hauzaw hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lawmte aw, note tu-in Isaac banga kamciemna’ tate na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hizongle tua hun lai-in cilesa dan tawh a suoh pa in Hlagau dan tawh a suoh pa a na bawlsiet bangin tu-in zong tua bang ma-in a bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanle Lai Siengtho in bang a gen ei? “Sila numei le a tapa notdawh ta’n; azieh pen sila numei’ tapa in a suohta numei’ tapa tawh gou luoton thei lo ding hi,” na kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahile lawmte aw, eite pen sila numei’ tate i hi sih vua, suohta numei’ tate i hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Azieh pen suotahna i nga nadingin Khris in eite ei suohtasah hi. Tua ahi ziehin suotahna sungah dingkipin saltanna hahkol kisuonkia nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai un! Keima Paul in na kung vuah kang gen ding hi, tep na kitansah uleh Khris in note adingin kimanna a nei poma sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tep a kitansah mi zosie tunga teci kang pan kiana-ah, tua mi pa in adang thukham vannuoi a zui lo a phamaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukham zuina tawh dihtan a sawm note na hi ule Khris tawh kikhenin hepina panin a puamat na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote in upna tawh a kinga dihna pen Hlagau tungtawnin lametna tawh lawptahin ka nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Khris sungah teptan mi hile, teptan lo mi hile bangma thupi lo hi; itna tungtawna nasep theina upna khat beh a thupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note na hi uleh taikidemna-ah hoitahin na tai uhi; note in thuman thutah na zui lo nadingun koi in ang kham ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam bang kizawlna pen note ang hlanpa kung pan hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tol themno khat in annel lom buppi a zel sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in lungsim tuom nei sih va uteh, ci-in Topa sungah kang muong uhi. Ahi vangin koikoi hinanle note ang subuoi poma in dan a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongnanle sanggamte aw, teptanna thu a gen lai hi leng bang dinga ei kibawlsie lailai ding ahei? Tua banga hil hi leng singlamte zieha mawsahna a kihemkhie zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note ang buoisah mite ama le ama kiget vet uleh ka nuom hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sanggamte aw, no na hi ule a suohta dinga ang kihlante na hi vua, na suotahna uh noma’ dei banga gamtatna dingin zang loin, itna tungtawnin khatlekhat’ sila na suohzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thupieh khat beh ahi, “Nangma na ki-it bangin na vengte na it ding hi,” a ci in thukham buppi a huomsieng ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin note khatlekhat kipet kibalin na op ule zong khatlekhat na kisietsuo khah lo nadingun kidawm bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hlagau tawh na nungta unlen cilesa lunggulnate na tangtungsah sih un, kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile cilesa lunggulnate in Hlagau deina tawh kiledo a, Hlagau deinate in zong cilesa lunggulna tawh kiledo hi; azieh pen tahsa deina pen Hlagau’ deina tawh a ki-elngat a, Hlagau’ deina zong khu tahsa’ deina tawh a ki-elngat hi; bangzieh ahei cile tam tegel pen khatlekhat a kiledo uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle Hlagau in ang makai uleh thukham nei-ah na om sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in cilesa nasepnate kician mama a, tuate in: numei-pasal pahtatna, siengtho lona, thangtatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milim biehna, mibumna, mudana, kimat lona, thangsietna, lungthahna, kihauna, kilungtawh lona, kipawl khenna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />deigawna, zukhamna, a kalval guolnop pawi bawlnate le tua bang nam zosie ahi hi; nidanga kang genkholsa bangin kang genkhol ding hi: Tam bang sil a bawl mite in Pasien’ manggam a luo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kilebulin gen vai ci lei, Hlagau’ ga in ki-itna, lungdamna, kilemna, lungduoina, migitna, kiphalna, muonhuoina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nunnemna le pumpi uhzawhnate ahi hi. Tam thute tawh a kituoh lo thukham khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khris Jesu-a’ ahi mite in a cilesa deinate ule a lunggulnate uh singlamte tungah a kilcip zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hlagau vanga nungta i hi uleh eite zong Hlagau makaina bangin kalsuon vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eite kiphasah loin khatlekhat kidem loin, khatlekhat zong kithangsiet sih va vui.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lawmte aw, mi khatpo in khielna bawl hi, ci-a na thei uleh Hlagau a ngasa note in lungsim nunnem tawh tua mipa na phongkia ding uhi. Ze-etna na thuoh lo nadingun no le no kikem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khatlekhat vangih na kipuohpi un, tua hile tam bang dan tawh Khris’ thukham na tangtun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen bangma ahi lote a kithupi ngaisut uleh amau le amau kisol ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zosie in a vengte’ nasepna tawh ki-ette zaw loin amau’ nasepna ciet kisittel phot uheh; tua hile a kisielna uh ahang pen a nasepna uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie in amau’ van ciet a puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien’ thu a kihil mite in amau’ siepa tawh sil hoi bangkim a ngaton valon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi kisolsah sih un; Pasien pen simmawbawl thei ahi sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile na vaw bangin na atkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cilesa ading khaici na vaw leh cilesa panin sietna na at ding hi; ahi vangin Hlagau adingin khaici na vaw leh Hlagau pan ma-in kumtawn hinna na at ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin na hoi sep ding cimtah sih vai, azieh pen lungkie lo-a i sep nah po leh a hun tun ciengin a ga i at ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n hun lemtang i nei petun mi zosie adingin sil hoi bawlin, a deudeu-in upna lama innkuonpite tungah bawl vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima’ khut tawh kang giel laimal golpite en vawi vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cilesa lamah mihoi a hina uh a talang nuomte in Khris’ singlamte zieha bawlsietna a thuoh lo nadingun note teptan dinga ang paubawl uh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tep kitansa mite nangawn in thukham a zui tuon sih vua, ahi vangin na cilesa tung vuah amate ang kisiel nop ziehun tep ang tansah nuom uh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ka hi leh Topa Jesu Khris’ singlamte simlo bang khatpo ka kisielpi ngai sih ding hi, tua singlamte ziehin keima tungah leitung kikhailia-in, keima zong leitungah ka kikhailia zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen teptanna le teptan lona pen a thupi hi loin, a thupi pen siemthana hizaw hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami zui ding thu banga kalsuon sawmte tung le Pasien’ minam Israel-te tungah lungnopna le hepina om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-a kipanin koima in ei subuoi ta sih heh; azieh pen ka pumpi tungah Jesu’ melcina himapawn a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, i Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina in na hlagau utawh hing om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
